desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Puppeteer Exposed Chrome Devtools"
	title_zh: "检测到 Puppeteer 暴露 Chrome 远程调试端口",
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-puppeteer-exposed-chrome-devtools"
	risk: "security-misconfiguration"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Remote debugging protocol does not perform any authentication, so exposing it too widely can be a security risk.

### 风险类型
安全配置不当（security-misconfiguration）

### 影响
安全相关配置缺失或过于宽松，可能暴露敏感功能或降低整体防护能力。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: context-aware regex — remote debugging flags are kept only in files containing `require('puppeteer')`.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-94: Improper Control of Generation of Code ('Code Injection')
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
按最小权限原则收紧配置，显式启用安全选项，并定期审计配置项。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.js": <<<POS
const puppeteer = require('puppeteer');
const args = ['--remote-debugging-port=9222'];
POS
	"safefile://neg.js": <<<NEG
const puppeteer = require('puppeteer');
// no remote debugging flags
NEG
)

${*}.pattern_regex(/require\(\s*['"]puppeteer['"]\s*\)/) as $ctx
$ctx.regexp(/--remote-debugging-(?:address|port|socket-name|targets)/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Puppeteer Exposed Chrome Devtools",
	title_zh: "检测到 Puppeteer 暴露 Chrome 远程调试端口",
	message: "Puppeteer remote debugging is exposed without authentication.",
}
